49
00:01:58,260 --> 00:02:03,140
EPISODE 42:
TSUBASA, THE PHOENIX

50
00:01:58,790 --> 00:02:04,680
Tsubasa-kun is preparing to shoot as soon as he enters Hirado's half!

51
00:02:10,260 --> 00:02:11,560
Have you lost your mind, Tsubasa?!

52
00:02:11,560 --> 00:02:12,540
Are you panicking?!

53
00:02:12,540 --> 00:02:14,500
Shooting from there is pointless.

54
00:02:14,500 --> 00:02:15,810
T-This...

55
00:02:15,810 --> 00:02:17,320
So you're going to use it now, Tsubasa...

56
00:02:17,780 --> 00:02:19,200
It's still flawed...

57
00:02:19,960 --> 00:02:21,240
Drive Shot: Diving Shot, Eagle Shot

58
00:02:19,960 --> 00:02:21,240
Drive Shot!

59
00:02:21,720 --> 00:02:24,540
He takes a long shot with everything he has!

60
00:02:26,420 --> 00:02:29,040
Hatayama, there's no need for you to struggle, you know.

61
00:02:29,730 --> 00:02:32,880
If it's off target, it doesn't matter how powerful the kick is.

62
00:02:43,180 --> 00:02:43,850
What?!

63
00:02:45,290 --> 00:02:47,350
Oh... It's in!

64
00:02:50,800 --> 00:02:51,600
It's in!

65
00:02:51,600 --> 00:02:52,480
You did it!

66
00:02:52,480 --> 00:02:53,980
You finally did it!

67
00:02:53,980 --> 00:02:56,240
Well done, Tsubasa!

68
00:02:56,860 --> 00:02:58,010
Hooray!

69
00:02:58,010 --> 00:02:59,010
Yes!

70
00:02:59,010 --> 00:03:01,950
You finally scored with the Drive Shot, Tsubasa!

71
00:02:59,010 --> 00:03:04,200
Drive Shot: Diving Shot, Eagle Shot

72
00:03:02,590 --> 00:03:04,200
Drive Shot...?

73
00:03:04,200 --> 00:03:09,260
Tsubasa's shot seemed like it would hit the goalpost,

74
00:03:09,260 --> 00:03:13,910
but thanks to the sharp spin of the ball, it dived right in!

75
00:03:11,420 --> 00:03:12,880
So you finally did it...

76
00:03:12,880 --> 00:03:13,680
Yes.

77
00:03:13,680 --> 00:03:15,520
The Drive Shot is magnificent!

78
00:03:13,910 --> 00:03:16,420
It tore the net!

79
00:03:15,520 --> 00:03:16,420
Tsubasa!

80
00:03:16,420 --> 00:03:18,720
He did it! He did it!

81
00:03:16,420 --> 00:03:19,070
Finally, he has perfected the Drive Shot

82
00:03:18,720 --> 00:03:19,670
Tsubasa...

83
00:03:19,070 --> 00:03:21,750
which he attempted countless times in this tournament.

84
00:03:21,750 --> 00:03:23,340
Damn it! That was just a fluke, you know!

85
00:03:23,770 --> 00:03:26,850
A shot like that can only be luck, you know...

86
00:03:26,850 --> 00:03:29,560
It's only been one minute since the second half started.

87
00:03:29,560 --> 00:03:32,560
Hirado concedes a goal for the first time in this tournament.

88
00:03:32,560 --> 00:03:35,130
That diving spin was magnificent.

89
00:03:35,130 --> 00:03:36,690
Can a ball drop like that?

90
00:03:36,690 --> 00:03:38,690
I wouldn't just call it dropping.

91
00:03:38,690 --> 00:03:39,930
It was literally diving!

92
00:03:39,930 --> 00:03:43,320
The ball swiftly attacked the net from above.

93
00:03:43,320 --> 00:03:44,320
Tsubasa...

94
00:03:47,560 --> 00:03:50,260
It was like a bird spreading its wings to the sky

95
00:03:50,260 --> 00:03:52,980
to catch its prey before diving.

96
00:03:52,980 --> 00:03:55,630
Drive Shot: Diving Shot, Eagle Shot

97
00:03:52,980 --> 00:03:55,630
This is Tsubasa Ozora's Drive Shot.

98
00:03:56,250 --> 00:04:00,750
So far, his attempts either struck the post or missed, but

99
00:04:00,750 --> 00:04:05,240
this time, at any cost, he scored.

100
00:04:05,780 --> 00:04:09,080
Despite all this pressure, Tsubasa Ozora

101
00:04:09,080 --> 00:04:12,440
persevered and unveiled his true skills.

102
00:04:13,620 --> 00:04:16,070
Moreover, he overcame the obstacles

103
00:04:16,070 --> 00:04:18,570
caused by his shoulder injury and was reborn like a phoenix.

104
00:04:18,570 --> 00:04:21,440
You are truly an extraordinary man.

105
00:04:21,440 --> 00:04:22,490
Yahoo!

106
00:04:22,490 --> 00:04:24,320
You finally did it, Tsubasa!

107
00:04:24,320 --> 00:04:26,820
Great! You're amazing, Tsubasa!

108
00:04:27,340 --> 00:04:29,080
Nankatsu steals the ball.

109
00:04:29,560 --> 00:04:31,430
After scoring one against Hirado, Nankatsu

110
00:04:31,430 --> 00:04:33,340
continues to attack Hirado's half.

111
00:04:36,560 --> 00:04:38,920
Sano from Hirado catches the ball once more.

112
00:04:44,910 --> 00:04:45,960
Damn it!

113
00:04:45,960 --> 00:04:49,180
Tsubasa was distracted and the ball was stolen.

114
00:04:50,120 --> 00:04:51,310
Tsubasa!

115
00:04:52,160 --> 00:04:54,220
And the ball was passed to Tsubasa!

116
00:04:54,220 --> 00:04:56,650
The combination play was executed perfectly!

117
00:05:04,820 --> 00:05:07,820
Tsubasa turns around and immediately takes a long shot!

118
00:05:07,820 --> 00:05:08,700
What!?

119
00:05:12,570 --> 00:05:14,530
It's in!

120
00:05:14,530 --> 00:05:16,420
The goalkeeper can't even move a muscle.

121
00:05:17,140 --> 00:05:18,930
Another Drive Shot!

122
00:05:17,140 --> 00:05:18,930
Drive Shot: Diving Shot, Eagle Shot

123
00:05:18,930 --> 00:05:20,370
A second goal from Tsubasa!

124
00:05:20,370 --> 00:05:22,420
Nice shot, Tsubasa!

125
00:05:25,700 --> 00:05:27,470
We need two more goals to turn the game around.

126
00:05:27,920 --> 00:05:29,640
We're in the 3rd minute of the second half.

127
00:05:29,640 --> 00:05:34,480
Thanks to Tsubasa's second Drive Shot, the gap is down to one.

128
00:05:29,640 --> 00:05:34,480
Drive Shot: Diving Shot, Eagle Shot

129
00:05:34,480 --> 00:05:37,730
Tsubasa Ozora is the superstar of middle school football!

130
00:05:37,730 --> 00:05:41,460
Despite his injuries, he shows his determination for victory.

131
00:05:41,460 --> 00:05:42,690
Just two more...

132
00:05:42,690 --> 00:05:45,790
Even if I permanently ruin my shoulder or my leg,

133
00:05:45,790 --> 00:05:48,910
I will definitely score these last two goals!

134
00:05:49,460 --> 00:05:51,190
This is the Tsubasa I know.

135
00:05:51,190 --> 00:05:53,840
To master such a wonderful shot...

136
00:05:53,840 --> 00:05:56,080
It's the definition of a perfect long shot.

137
00:05:56,080 --> 00:05:58,880
While I was sidelined these last two years,

138
00:05:58,880 --> 00:06:02,090
Tsubasa managed to develop something this impressive...

139
00:06:02,560 --> 00:06:04,500
I'm happy, Tsubasa.

140
00:06:04,500 --> 00:06:07,590
I didn't know you had mastered such a shot.

141
00:06:07,590 --> 00:06:13,350
But I also have my own super shot that suits my right leg...

142
00:06:14,030 --> 00:06:17,870
God... I really want to see Tsubasa Ozora's Drive Shot

143
00:06:14,030 --> 00:06:17,870
Drive Shot: Diving Shot, Eagle Shot

144
00:06:17,870 --> 00:06:21,710
go up against Kojiro Hyuga's Tiger Shot.

145
00:06:17,870 --> 00:06:21,710
Tiger Shot

146
00:06:22,110 --> 00:06:26,550
During Toho's first match, I saw that shot of his from the bench.

147
00:06:26,550 --> 00:06:29,800
That's why I called it the "Tiger Shot".

148
00:06:26,550 --> 00:06:31,120
Tiger Shot

149
00:06:29,800 --> 00:06:31,120
Tiger Shot...

150
00:06:31,120 --> 00:06:33,290
It has a nice ring to it, doesn't it?

151
00:06:33,290 --> 00:06:35,370
Ah, I should introduce myself.

152
00:06:35,370 --> 00:06:37,870
I'm Tajima from Toto Sports.

153
00:06:37,870 --> 00:06:39,820
Nice to meet you.

154
00:06:42,380 --> 00:06:44,800
TSUBASA OZORA
DRIVE SHOT COMPLETED!

155
00:06:43,300 --> 00:06:44,800
Our headline is ready.

156
00:06:44,800 --> 00:06:49,050
It'll be wasted if Nankatsu loses, but...

157
00:06:49,050 --> 00:06:51,050
Make sure you win, Tsubasa-kun!

158
00:06:53,750 --> 00:06:55,840
Hirado's dominance over Nankatsu is over!

159
00:06:55,840 --> 00:06:59,480
Surprisingly, their defender Jito is standing at the center line.

160
00:06:59,480 --> 00:07:00,440
I'm coming, you know!

161
00:07:02,930 --> 00:07:04,300
The game continues.

162
00:07:04,300 --> 00:07:07,780
Sano leaves the ball to Jito
and sprints towards Nankatsu's goal.

163
00:07:07,780 --> 00:07:10,450
I'll get it!

164
00:07:10,450 --> 00:07:11,300
What?!

165
00:07:11,300 --> 00:07:13,280
Jito doesn't even care!

166
00:07:13,910 --> 00:07:15,280
Damn, with this power...?!

167
00:07:15,280 --> 00:07:17,330
Sano quickly advances towards the goal.

168
00:07:19,540 --> 00:07:21,370
Sano breaks free from the defense.

169
00:07:23,310 --> 00:07:24,740
Here we go, Sano.

170
00:07:24,740 --> 00:07:27,100
Our combination play is invincible, you know!

171
00:07:27,100 --> 00:07:29,080
We'll take back every goal we conceded, you know!

172
00:07:29,080 --> 00:07:31,090
Jito's special bullet pass.

173
00:07:31,090 --> 00:07:32,640
It won't go as you wish!

174
00:07:33,530 --> 00:07:35,890
Izawa blocks it with his whole body!

175
00:07:35,890 --> 00:07:36,640
What?!

176
00:07:36,640 --> 00:07:37,680
Izawa!

177
00:07:41,230 --> 00:07:43,450
Don't let Izawa's sacrifice go to waste!

178
00:07:43,450 --> 00:07:44,980
We'll hold this guy!

179
00:07:44,980 --> 00:07:47,900
Damn it! Then I'll have to do it myself, you know!

180
00:07:50,820 --> 00:07:54,820
Morisaki, stay where you are! This one will spin back too!

181
00:07:54,820 --> 00:07:55,570
How!?

182
00:07:55,570 --> 00:07:56,950
I got it, Tsubasa!

183
00:07:56,950 --> 00:07:59,960
Don't give them any opening! We'll keep marking Sano!

184
00:07:59,960 --> 00:08:00,330
Okay!

185
00:08:03,000 --> 00:08:05,580
The ball spins backwards!

186
00:08:05,580 --> 00:08:09,090
My combination with the captain is invincible...!

187
00:08:12,420 --> 00:08:13,500
He did it!

188
00:08:13,500 --> 00:08:15,500
Morisaki caught it tightly.

189
00:08:16,260 --> 00:08:17,510
Nice, Morisaki!

190
00:08:17,510 --> 00:08:19,850
Our combination play...

191
00:08:19,850 --> 00:08:21,020
See?

192
00:08:21,020 --> 00:08:23,600
You can't fool us twice with the same old trick!

193
00:08:23,600 --> 00:08:26,110
Nankatsu's defense has also strengthened.

194
00:08:26,110 --> 00:08:27,110
Here!

195
00:08:27,110 --> 00:08:28,320
Damn it!

196
00:08:28,750 --> 00:08:32,470
The ball is quickly sent to number 10, Tsubasa.

197
00:08:38,410 --> 00:08:42,250
Will Tsubasa immediately take another Drive Shot?!

198
00:08:38,410 --> 00:08:42,250
Drive Shot: Diving Shot, Eagle Shot

199
00:08:42,250 --> 00:08:43,790
I won't let you!

200
00:08:44,470 --> 00:08:47,460
Jito goes to block the Drive Shot.

201
00:08:44,470 --> 00:08:47,460
Drive Shot: Diving Shot, Eagle Shot

202
00:08:48,670 --> 00:08:51,170
Go!

203
00:08:53,230 --> 00:08:55,300
I saw blood!

204
00:08:55,300 --> 00:08:57,510
The ball goes out of bounds.

205
00:08:57,510 --> 00:08:58,510
Jito!

206
00:08:59,540 --> 00:09:03,020
It seems Jito directly stopped Tsubasa's shot with his face.

207
00:09:04,150 --> 00:09:06,980
The game is stopped for treatment.

208
00:09:08,130 --> 00:09:09,700
Are you okay, Jito?

209
00:09:09,700 --> 00:09:10,480
Captain!

210
00:09:11,580 --> 00:09:16,980
I thought the game was over in the first half, but you Nankatsu, you know...

211
00:09:16,980 --> 00:09:22,380
For me, who takes all kinds of punches in a fight, to split my eyebrow with one shot...

212
00:09:22,380 --> 00:09:25,960
Your Drive Shot is quite powerful.

213
00:09:22,380 --> 00:09:25,960
Drive Shot: Diving Shot, Eagle Shot

214
00:09:25,960 --> 00:09:29,960
Congratulations... Congratulations, you know, Tsubasa Ozora!

215
00:09:30,840 --> 00:09:34,800
But I've been hoping for this all along.

216
00:09:34,800 --> 00:09:39,470
The bigger my opponent, the more meaningful it is to crush them.

217
00:09:42,130 --> 00:09:44,480
You heard our captain.

218
00:09:44,480 --> 00:09:47,400
The real match starts now.

219
00:09:53,510 --> 00:09:56,610
The game resumes with Nankatsu's throw-in.

220
00:09:57,610 --> 00:09:58,450
Here I go!

221
00:09:59,080 --> 00:09:59,840
Watch out!

222
00:09:59,840 --> 00:10:01,950
He's going to send it in front of the goal!

223
00:10:02,400 --> 00:10:04,700
We'll score with a header!

224
00:10:04,700 --> 00:10:05,960
Okay!

225
00:10:05,960 --> 00:10:08,090
Their numbers don't matter; there's only one ball!

226
00:10:08,090 --> 00:10:09,830
I won't lose the aerial battle, you know!

227
00:10:12,090 --> 00:10:12,750
What?!

228
00:10:12,750 --> 00:10:13,960
Alright!

229
00:10:13,960 --> 00:10:15,960
Here, Tsubasa!

230
00:10:15,960 --> 00:10:17,960
The ball was sent to Tsubasa!

231
00:10:17,960 --> 00:10:21,930
The four Nankatsu players in front of the goal were a decoy!

232
00:10:22,930 --> 00:10:24,140
Tsubasa!

233
00:10:26,770 --> 00:10:29,020
Drive Shot: Diving Shot, Eagle Shot

234
00:10:26,770 --> 00:10:29,020
Unless we stop the Drive Shot,

235
00:10:29,020 --> 00:10:31,270
we have no guarantee of winning this game!

236
00:10:31,270 --> 00:10:33,520
Sano rushes towards Tsubasa!

237
00:10:33,520 --> 00:10:37,530
But Tsubasa's focus is on the ball and scoring a goal!

238
00:10:37,530 --> 00:10:39,360
Go!

239
00:10:39,360 --> 00:10:41,120
Drive Shot!

240
00:10:39,360 --> 00:10:41,120
Drive Shot: Diving Shot, Eagle Shot

241
00:10:43,270 --> 00:10:45,830
Sano-kun flies into the air!

242
00:10:47,880 --> 00:10:48,830
Sano!

243
00:10:48,830 --> 00:10:50,750
The ball is still in play.

244
00:10:50,750 --> 00:10:53,080
Tsubasa runs towards the ball.

245
00:10:54,340 --> 00:10:57,920
Since the start of the half, he has had an intense obsession with the score.

246
00:10:57,920 --> 00:10:59,260
Damn it!

247
00:11:00,170 --> 00:11:03,180
Tsubasa prepares for his fifth Drive Shot today!

248
00:11:00,170 --> 00:11:08,020
Drive Shot: Diving Shot, Eagle Shot

249
00:11:05,390 --> 00:11:08,020
Tsubasa! If you use the Drive Shot any more...

250
00:11:11,520 --> 00:11:16,530
~Anime Lovers~
Instagram: AnimeSeverlerrr

251
00:11:16,530 --> 00:11:19,740
Tsubasa prepares for his fifth Drive Shot today!

252
00:11:16,530 --> 00:11:19,740
Drive Shot: Diving Shot, Eagle Shot

253
00:11:21,670 --> 00:11:24,410
Jito hurries to block it!

254
00:11:28,870 --> 00:11:32,960
Whoa! Jito catches the Drive Shot directly with his body!

255
00:11:28,870 --> 00:11:32,960
Drive Shot: Diving Shot, Eagle Shot

256
00:11:33,790 --> 00:11:36,550
But even Jito's giant body is sent flying!

257
00:11:38,710 --> 00:11:41,150
Hirado persistently protects the goal!

258
00:11:41,150 --> 00:11:43,220
They won't let their opponents tie so easily.

259
00:11:43,220 --> 00:11:46,720
Ah, Tsubasa advances towards the ball once more.

260
00:11:46,720 --> 00:11:48,140
Not yet!

261
00:11:48,140 --> 00:11:50,480
My Drive Shot has not been defeated yet!

262
00:11:48,140 --> 00:12:01,570
Drive Shot: Diving Shot, Eagle Shot

263
00:11:50,480 --> 00:11:54,650
The Drive Shot that Roberto taught me is invincible!

264
00:11:57,010 --> 00:12:01,570
The sixth, and third consecutive, Drive Shot!

265
00:12:01,570 --> 00:12:05,030
Damn it, as if I'll let you catch up to us!

266
00:12:05,540 --> 00:12:08,870
Jito goes to repel it again!

267
00:12:12,920 --> 00:12:16,170
His defense truly shows fighting spirit!

268
00:12:18,700 --> 00:12:20,810
He stopped it!

269
00:12:22,950 --> 00:12:25,930
B-But... This...

270
00:12:29,150 --> 00:12:33,140
G... Goal! 3-3, the game is tied!

271
00:12:33,140 --> 00:12:37,860
Even though Jito successfully stopped the Drive Shot, it crossed the goal line.

272
00:12:33,140 --> 00:12:37,860
Drive Shot: Diving Shot, Eagle Shot

273
00:12:39,270 --> 00:12:41,420
Good job, Tsubasa!

274
00:12:41,420 --> 00:12:43,280
You did it, Tsubasa-senpai!

275
00:12:44,040 --> 00:12:45,280
I failed, you know.

276
00:12:46,060 --> 00:12:49,060
With his third shot, Tsubasa took the lead and

277
00:12:49,060 --> 00:12:52,120
finally managed to send Jito flying.

278
00:12:52,120 --> 00:12:54,700
The equalizer made the score 3-3.

279
00:12:54,700 --> 00:12:57,580
He scored three straight points with his Drive Shot!

280
00:12:54,700 --> 00:12:57,580
Drive Shot: Diving Shot, Eagle Shot

281
00:12:58,500 --> 00:13:00,910
A tie, we caught up.

282
00:13:00,910 --> 00:13:02,140
Just one more left.

283
00:13:02,140 --> 00:13:03,570
Just one more goal.

284
00:13:06,050 --> 00:13:06,830
Tsubasa!

285
00:13:06,830 --> 00:13:07,470
What–

286
00:13:07,200 --> 00:13:10,350
Did he let himself go after a sixth Drive Shot?

287
00:13:07,200 --> 00:13:10,350
Drive Shot: Diving Shot, Eagle Shot

288
00:13:08,220 --> 00:13:09,100
Tsubasa!

289
00:13:10,350 --> 00:13:13,120
Tsubasa is on the ground once more.

290
00:13:13,120 --> 00:13:14,640
One more goal.

291
00:13:14,640 --> 00:13:16,100
I just need to get one more.

292
00:13:16,100 --> 00:13:17,330
Damn it.

293
00:13:17,330 --> 00:13:18,710
The score is tied.

294
00:13:18,710 --> 00:13:20,610
We haven't lost, you know!

295
00:13:20,610 --> 00:13:21,660
Tsubasa...

296
00:13:21,660 --> 00:13:22,760
Tsubasa!

297
00:13:25,090 --> 00:13:26,820
So the game is tied, huh...?

298
00:13:26,820 --> 00:13:27,990
Tsubasa!

299
00:13:27,990 --> 00:13:30,440
Sorry, everyone.

300
00:13:30,440 --> 00:13:32,830
As captain, I'm pretty pathetic, aren't I...?

301
00:13:33,430 --> 00:13:37,220
I keep falling to the ground without any dignity...

302
00:13:37,220 --> 00:13:38,870
What are you talking about, Tsubasa?!

303
00:13:38,870 --> 00:13:40,330
Why did you say you're pathetic?!

304
00:13:40,330 --> 00:13:42,090
Even after scoring three goals...

305
00:13:42,090 --> 00:13:44,790
Hey, Tsubasa, take a breath.

306
00:13:44,790 --> 00:13:47,510
We will definitely stop them from scoring again.

307
00:13:47,510 --> 00:13:50,550
We still have time to turn the game around.

308
00:13:50,550 --> 00:13:52,510
While you recover, we'll push ourselves.

309
00:13:53,210 --> 00:13:54,510
Okay.

310
00:13:54,510 --> 00:13:56,020
Thanks, everyone.

311
00:13:57,680 --> 00:13:59,270
Come on, Nankatsu!

312
00:14:00,130 --> 00:14:01,770
The power show begins now.

313
00:14:04,730 --> 00:14:05,780
Sano...

314
00:14:06,290 --> 00:14:09,660
Damn, still... Two Drive Shots, huh?

315
00:14:06,290 --> 00:14:09,660
Drive Shot: Diving Shot, Eagle Shot

316
00:14:09,660 --> 00:14:12,830
This hurts more than the kicks I've taken in a fight.

317
00:14:13,440 --> 00:14:15,470
Now that Hirado has given up their lead,

318
00:14:15,470 --> 00:14:17,500
how will they get back into this game?

319
00:14:18,020 --> 00:14:20,930
The match restarts with Hirado's kick-off.

320
00:14:20,930 --> 00:14:23,250
We've just returned to where we started.

321
00:14:24,800 --> 00:14:26,420
Here I come, Nankatsu!

322
00:14:26,420 --> 00:14:30,470
I'll score the winning goal as Hirado's forward!

323
00:14:30,470 --> 00:14:32,030
Go, Hirado!

324
00:14:32,030 --> 00:14:32,970
It's just a tie!

325
00:14:33,900 --> 00:14:36,920
Kisugi and Taki were easily left behind!

326
00:14:36,920 --> 00:14:40,100
Their movements still seem sluggish in the second half.

327
00:14:41,610 --> 00:14:46,570
Even Tsubasa looks very tired
after his sixth Drive Shot.

328
00:14:41,610 --> 00:14:46,570
Drive Shot: Diving Shot, Eagle Shot

329
00:14:47,160 --> 00:14:49,020
I won't let you go any further!

330
00:14:49,020 --> 00:14:51,740
Is he the one they can rely on under these conditions?

331
00:14:55,880 --> 00:14:59,040
Which one will win this confrontation?

332
00:15:01,030 --> 00:15:01,870
What–

333
00:15:01,870 --> 00:15:04,040
Ishizaki stole the ball!

334
00:15:06,040 --> 00:15:08,220
There's still plenty left in the tank!

335
00:15:08,220 --> 00:15:09,690
It won't go as you planned!

336
00:15:09,690 --> 00:15:12,520
We don't plan on relying on Jito and Sano forever!

337
00:15:12,520 --> 00:15:14,970
We are also members of Hirado!

338
00:15:14,970 --> 00:15:15,890
Whoa!

339
00:15:16,980 --> 00:15:18,020
Huh?!

340
00:15:18,020 --> 00:15:19,890
Ishizaki loses the ball.

341
00:15:19,890 --> 00:15:21,400
Everyone...

342
00:15:21,400 --> 00:15:23,750
This is thanks to you, Jito.

343
00:15:23,750 --> 00:15:24,400
Huh?

344
00:15:24,400 --> 00:15:26,990
Because you started playing football seriously,

345
00:15:26,990 --> 00:15:29,570
the others were able to perform this well.

346
00:15:30,110 --> 00:15:33,820
So far, they've been able to challenge the champion Nankatsu.

347
00:15:33,820 --> 00:15:37,580
A football team needs at least 11 people.

348
00:15:38,450 --> 00:15:41,000
Yes... You're absolutely right.

349
00:15:41,000 --> 00:15:42,870
Time is running out in the second half.

350
00:15:42,870 --> 00:15:45,500
The next goal will determine the winner of this match.

351
00:15:45,500 --> 00:15:47,000
Send it here, you know!

352
00:15:47,580 --> 00:15:49,720
Jito quickly advances to the front line!

353
00:15:49,720 --> 00:15:51,260
Five minutes left!

354
00:15:51,670 --> 00:15:52,930
The ball was sent to Jito.

355
00:15:56,250 --> 00:15:57,970
But the pass is too high!

356
00:15:57,970 --> 00:15:59,470
I'm coming!

357
00:16:01,810 --> 00:16:05,310
Sano rose for a direct overhead kick!

358
00:16:05,310 --> 00:16:07,050
That's Tsubasa-kun!

359
00:16:07,050 --> 00:16:08,730
Tsubasa-kun jumped with everything he had!

360
00:16:08,730 --> 00:16:10,190
Thanks, Tsubasa!

361
00:16:10,890 --> 00:16:12,790
Morisaki makes a diving catch!

362
00:16:12,790 --> 00:16:13,820
They stopped it!

363
00:16:13,820 --> 00:16:14,820
Nankatsu stopped them!

364
00:16:17,120 --> 00:16:18,040
Come on, Morisaki!

365
00:16:18,040 --> 00:16:18,660
Throw it!

366
00:16:19,480 --> 00:16:20,370
Tsubasa!

367
00:16:22,940 --> 00:16:24,670
The ball now reaches Tsubasa.

368
00:16:24,670 --> 00:16:26,250
Damn it!

369
00:16:26,250 --> 00:16:27,770
Get back!

370
00:16:27,770 --> 00:16:29,260
Four minutes left!

371
00:16:29,260 --> 00:16:30,920
Nankatsu is counter-attacking!

372
00:16:31,310 --> 00:16:32,810
Go, Tsubasa!

373
00:16:32,810 --> 00:16:35,430
Finally, it's all up to you!

374
00:16:35,950 --> 00:16:37,050
One more!

375
00:16:37,050 --> 00:16:39,190
One more shot will decide the score.

376
00:16:39,190 --> 00:16:42,180
I'll run until I see the goal!

377
00:16:42,180 --> 00:16:46,420
Tsubasa's dribbling speed is as fast as a sprint.

378
00:16:46,420 --> 00:16:51,630
After all, it feels like he was born to play football!

379
00:16:51,630 --> 00:16:53,750
Keep going, Tsubasa!

380
00:16:53,750 --> 00:16:55,900
Tsubasa is very, very fast!

381
00:16:55,900 --> 00:16:58,950
No one in Hirado can catch up!

382
00:16:59,380 --> 00:17:01,200
I see it.

383
00:17:01,200 --> 00:17:02,430
Goal!

384
00:17:03,990 --> 00:17:07,170
So despite all your injuries, you're going

385
00:17:07,170 --> 00:17:10,380
to take another Drive Shot, Tsubasa Ozora?

386
00:17:07,170 --> 00:17:10,380
Drive Shot: Diving Shot, Eagle Shot

387
00:17:10,380 --> 00:17:13,970
If that's the case, I'll deal with it as much as I can

388
00:17:13,970 --> 00:17:16,220
until you run out of steam, you know!

389
00:17:16,640 --> 00:17:19,640
Everyone, you let me rest more than enough.

390
00:17:19,640 --> 00:17:23,430
So this time, I'll score the winning goal!

391
00:17:24,130 --> 00:17:25,850
I'll stop you before you kick it!

392
00:17:30,610 --> 00:17:32,780
What a fast kick!

393
00:17:34,280 --> 00:17:35,700
Come on, Tsubasa!

394
00:17:39,920 --> 00:17:41,210
What happened to Tsubasa?

395
00:17:41,210 --> 00:17:42,770
Shocking!

396
00:17:42,770 --> 00:17:43,460
Tsubasa!

397
00:17:43,460 --> 00:17:44,710
What's wrong?!

398
00:17:44,710 --> 00:17:46,980
Not good.

399
00:17:46,980 --> 00:17:49,210
I'm powerless...

400
00:17:49,210 --> 00:17:50,960
So your energy is exhausted, huh, Tsubasa?!

401
00:17:54,320 --> 00:17:55,310
Tsubasa!

402
00:17:55,310 --> 00:17:56,300
Tsubasa-kun.

403
00:17:56,300 --> 00:17:58,190
Trust them.

404
00:17:58,190 --> 00:17:59,430
Right, Tsubasa.

405
00:17:59,430 --> 00:18:01,850
Isn't football played with 11 people?

406
00:18:01,850 --> 00:18:04,140
Misaki-kun, Wakabayashi-kun...

407
00:18:04,710 --> 00:18:06,410
Exactly as they said, Tsubasa.

408
00:18:06,410 --> 00:18:08,940
You can't play football alone.

409
00:18:08,940 --> 00:18:10,090
Roberto!

410
00:18:14,260 --> 00:18:14,900
Tsubasa!

411
00:18:15,800 --> 00:18:17,650
I trust you... Kisugi, Taki.

412
00:18:17,650 --> 00:18:20,230
Let's go! This is our last chance!

413
00:18:20,230 --> 00:18:23,200
We'll definitely put this ball we got from Tsubasa into the goal!

414
00:18:23,200 --> 00:18:25,130
If it's just the two of them, that's fine!

415
00:18:25,130 --> 00:18:26,910
We can easily intercept their passes.

416
00:18:26,910 --> 00:18:29,250
We won't let you make fools of us anymore!

417
00:18:29,250 --> 00:18:30,480
Let's go, Kisugi!

418
00:18:30,480 --> 00:18:31,040
Okay!

419
00:18:31,040 --> 00:18:33,960
They easily strung together a series of great one-two passes.

420
00:18:33,960 --> 00:18:36,380
They are in perfect sync!

421
00:18:36,380 --> 00:18:37,890
Of course!

422
00:18:37,890 --> 00:18:40,970
We've formed a duo since elementary school!

423
00:18:40,970 --> 00:18:44,420
We can't be compared to Misaki and Tsubasa's Golden Duo,

424
00:18:44,420 --> 00:18:46,980
but we are definitely very accomplished!

425
00:18:47,660 --> 00:18:49,930
I'll send you flying once more!

426
00:18:49,930 --> 00:18:51,480
As if I'd let that happen again!

427
00:18:52,580 --> 00:18:53,520
What?!

428
00:18:55,280 --> 00:19:01,160
Shutetsu's former striker Teppei
Kisugi has become Nankatsu's goal scorer!

429
00:19:03,120 --> 00:19:05,310
It's in! Goal!

430
00:19:05,310 --> 00:19:06,760
Yeah, Kisugi!

431
00:19:06,760 --> 00:19:08,080
He did it!

432
00:19:09,710 --> 00:19:10,830
Finally.

433
00:19:10,830 --> 00:19:12,080
Nankatsu...

434
00:19:12,080 --> 00:19:13,690
Only one minute left.

435
00:19:13,690 --> 00:19:15,590
Nankatsu finally made a comeback.

436
00:19:15,590 --> 00:19:20,050
Taki and Kisugi scored the fourth goal!

437
00:19:20,050 --> 00:19:24,510
Right, football is played with 11 people.

438
00:19:24,510 --> 00:19:26,510
You must trust your friends.

439
00:19:26,510 --> 00:19:28,560
Kisugi, Taki.

440
00:19:28,560 --> 00:19:30,560
Thank you!

441
00:19:30,560 --> 00:19:32,330
It was a piece of cake!

442
00:19:32,330 --> 00:19:35,070
You guys did a good job on defense too!

443
00:19:35,070 --> 00:19:37,090
That goal had your share in it!

444
00:19:37,090 --> 00:19:39,310
Tsubasa senpai is truly amazing!

445
00:19:39,310 --> 00:19:42,650
Oh, you... Don't forget to cheer up Kisugi and Taki too!

446
00:19:42,650 --> 00:19:45,580
One more minute, we have to defend.

447
00:19:56,340 --> 00:19:58,840
Go!

448
00:20:00,020 --> 00:20:01,680
The match ends here!

449
00:20:01,680 --> 00:20:03,250
4-3!

450
00:20:03,250 --> 00:20:05,630
Nankatsu narrowly wins the game!

451
00:20:05,630 --> 00:20:09,300
Despite many difficulties, they secure their place in the top four for the third consecutive year!

452
00:20:09,300 --> 00:20:12,110
Two games away from the first three-peat championship.

453
00:20:12,110 --> 00:20:13,060
We won!

454
00:20:13,060 --> 00:20:15,100
It seems it'll be Nankatsu after all.

455
00:20:15,100 --> 00:20:15,650
Yes.

456
00:20:16,350 --> 00:20:18,150
So you won, Tsubasa.

457
00:20:18,150 --> 00:20:20,210
You did it, Tsubasa!

458
00:20:20,210 --> 00:20:23,660
It would have been terrible if you lost after perfecting your Drive Shot.

459
00:20:20,210 --> 00:20:23,660
Drive Shot: Diving Shot, Eagle Shot

460
00:20:24,320 --> 00:20:26,160
You did it, Tsubasa.

461
00:20:26,160 --> 00:20:28,640
Hirado did a good job despite competing

462
00:20:28,640 --> 00:20:31,120
against the champion Nankatsu for the first time.

463
00:20:31,610 --> 00:20:35,370
With that, Tsubasa's Drive Shot, which tied the game,

464
00:20:31,610 --> 00:20:35,370
Drive Shot: Diving Shot, Eagle Shot

465
00:20:35,370 --> 00:20:37,480
was the crucial point of the game.

466
00:20:37,480 --> 00:20:40,970
The winning goal came from a perfect combination between Kisugi and Taki.

467
00:20:40,970 --> 00:20:45,140
They truly came together as a team and advanced to the semi-finals.

468
00:20:45,730 --> 00:20:48,890
In the end, Nankatsu's teamwork led them to victory.

469
00:20:49,950 --> 00:20:52,890
Now there's one more game for both of us to play, Tsubasa.

470
00:20:52,890 --> 00:20:54,020
Damn it.

471
00:20:54,020 --> 00:20:54,640
Damn it...

472
00:20:54,640 --> 00:20:56,160
Damn it!

473
00:20:57,870 --> 00:21:01,030
This loss was a long time ago, you know...

474
00:21:01,030 --> 00:21:03,450
Losing really hurts.

475
00:21:03,450 --> 00:21:06,030
However, strangely, I feel refreshed, you know.

476
00:21:07,980 --> 00:21:09,240
Stand up, Sano.

477
00:21:09,240 --> 00:21:10,040
Captain.

478
00:21:10,460 --> 00:21:11,630
Don't cry.

479
00:21:11,630 --> 00:21:13,830
You have one more year, you know.

480
00:21:13,830 --> 00:21:18,200
Make sure you come back here next year and win this time!

481
00:21:18,200 --> 00:21:18,920
Yes!

482
00:21:20,710 --> 00:21:22,420
Tsubasa Ozora...

483
00:21:22,420 --> 00:21:25,840
It would have been a one-year journey for me.

484
00:21:25,840 --> 00:21:28,120
But now, I don't think I can stop playing football

485
00:21:28,120 --> 00:21:30,430
until I defeat you.

486
00:21:31,010 --> 00:21:33,500
Before this, you were just a brawler...

487
00:21:33,500 --> 00:21:35,690
I'm truly proud of your growth, Hiroshi-kun.

488
00:21:40,660 --> 00:21:45,410
There are winners and those who advance, and also
losers and those eliminated.

489
00:21:45,410 --> 00:21:50,350
In this tournament held with 47 teams from all over the country,

490
00:21:50,350 --> 00:21:54,960
the final top four teams have finally been determined.

491
00:21:54,960 --> 00:21:59,880
The previous champions, Nankatsu
Middle School, representing Shizuoka.

492
00:22:00,590 --> 00:22:03,760
Furano Middle School, representing Hokkaido.

493
00:22:04,290 --> 00:22:07,760
Meiwa Higashi Middle School, representing Saitama Prefecture.

494
00:22:08,740 --> 00:22:11,760
Toho Academy, representing Tokyo.

495
00:22:12,880 --> 00:22:19,520
Tomorrow, these four teams will battle for the grand final seat.

